<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Güvenlik Kontrolü</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #0b1220;
      color: #e8eef8;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }
    .box { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; max-width: 28rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
    p { color: #9aa0b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .spin {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
      border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-top-color: #5b9fd4;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: s 0.9s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes s { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="spin" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h1>Bağlantınız doğrulanıyor</h1>
    <p>Bu işlem otomatiktir. Lütfen bekleyin…</p>
    <noscript>Devam etmek için JavaScript gerekir.</noscript>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
